iler":false,"text":"She is 33 years old and works as a librarian at a community center."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is the leader of the \"Mama's Club. She knows Jun's situation and therefore takes a sympathetic stance toward him."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is a pessimistic woman, characterized by her unmotivated behavior and facial expressions. She is always smoking. She is divorced but has no children."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From official site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c103417"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/43/430c8790e89f836ad53eeaaff9b648287921c5b385c8518c99f36b7d60c4c48b.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d6/d6167119f0bb0e4c695fd50bc88f63d16ffd1573294fa04d681eb371d1fafe4d.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c103418","characterName":"来島 弥生","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c103418"},"originalCharacterName":"来島 弥生","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"37"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is 37 years old and the head nurse at Tanizaki General Hospital. She is Jun's subordinate at work and is a frequent visitor to the Tanizaki residence."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is Jun's father's mistress and is currently having an affair with him. Jun uses this as leverage against her to get her to become his mistress as well."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She distributes contraceptives procured from the hospital to women who are members of the \"mama club\"."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From official site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c103418"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConf